# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# User data. Generated at runtime and PRIVATE: recordings capture real
# keystrokes, Assets are screenshots of whatever was on screen, settings.json
# holds the Discord webhook URL. None of it belongs in the repository.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
settings.json
settings.json.tmp
debug.log
debug/
Templates/
Recordings/
Assets/

# Anything a user drops beside the exe
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
!ui/**/*.png
!docs/**/*.png
